{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 14403378537934656728,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Dependencies in the development shell",
      "source_hash": 1716522435091886245,
      "context_hash": 12869504999697047073,
      "translation": "개발 셸의 의존성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dependencies": "의존성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:20:02.575472Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When [packaging software in `default.nix`](packaging-tutorial), you'll want a [development environment in `shell.nix`](declarative-reproducible-envs) to enter conveniently with `nix-shell` or [automatically with `direnv`](./direnv).",
      "source_hash": 1567556438984323457,
      "context_hash": 2760336734340483115,
      "translation": "[`default.nix`에서 소프트웨어를 패키징할 때](packaging-tutorial), [`shell.nix`의 개발 환경](declarative-reproducible-envs)을 `nix-shell`로 편리하게 진입하거나 [`direnv`로 자동으로](./direnv) 진입하고자 할 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "development environment": "개발 환경"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:20:02.575473Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "How to share the package's dependencies in `default.nix` with the development environment in `shell.nix`?",
      "source_hash": 17648904757139553107,
      "context_hash": 6729310569642640421,
      "translation": "`default.nix`의 패키지 의존성을 `shell.nix`의 개발 환경과 공유하려면 어떻게 해야 할까요?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dependencies": "의존성",
        "package": "패키지",
        "development environment": "개발 환경"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:20:02.575473Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Summary",
      "source_hash": 13527386753909660859,
      "context_hash": 18417872594227693528,
      "translation": "요약",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:20:02.575473Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Use the [`inputsFrom` attribute to `pkgs.mkShellNoCC`](https://nixos.org/manual/nixpkgs/stable/#sec-pkgs-mkShell-attributes):",
      "source_hash": 4994513914759019730,
      "context_hash": 16280274586433294943,
      "translation": "[`pkgs.mkShellNoCC`의 `inputsFrom` 속성](https://nixos.org/manual/nixpkgs/stable/#sec-pkgs-mkShell-attributes)을 사용하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "attribute": "속성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:20:02.575473Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Import the `shell` attribute in `shell.nix`:",
      "source_hash": 196424260323850399,
      "context_hash": 5170994949965390877,
      "translation": "`shell.nix`에서 `shell` 속성을 가져오십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "attribute": "속성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:20:02.575474Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Complete example",
      "source_hash": 9213945223499419938,
      "context_hash": 18195361585269536309,
      "translation": "완전한 예제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:20:02.575474Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Assume your package is defined in `package.nix`:",
      "source_hash": 1751550681420505343,
      "context_hash": 14820953816531829362,
      "translation": "패키지가 `package.nix`에 정의되어 있다고 가정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "package": "패키지"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:20:02.575474Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "In this example, `cowsay` is declared as a build-time dependency using `buildInputs`.",
      "source_hash": 17462750642335829600,
      "context_hash": 4470158597641389099,
      "translation": "이 예제에서 `cowsay`는 `buildInputs`를 사용해 빌드 타임 의존성으로 선언됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dependency": "의존성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:20:02.575474Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Further assume your project is defined in `default.nix`:",
      "source_hash": 7178605555184290689,
      "context_hash": 13998937700244552999,
      "translation": "또한 프로젝트가 `default.nix`에 정의되어 있다고 가정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:20:02.575474Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Add an attribute to `default.nix` specifying an environment:",
      "source_hash": 7387180045930390024,
      "context_hash": 9832027921429403160,
      "translation": "`default.nix`에 환경을 지정하는 속성을 추가합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "attribute": "속성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:20:02.575474Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Move the `myPackage` attribute into the `let` binding to be able to re-use it.",
      "source_hash": 16999828355556697929,
      "context_hash": 2001663336696674883,
      "translation": "`myPackage` 속성을 재사용할 수 있도록 `let` 바인딩 안으로 옮깁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "attribute": "속성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:20:02.575475Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:8/seg:1",
      "source": "Then take the package's dependencies into the environment with [`inputsFrom`](https://nixos.org/manual/nixpkgs/stable/#sec-pkgs-mkShell-attributes):",
      "source_hash": 10819826615402465485,
      "context_hash": 11241738497508806716,
      "translation": "그런 다음 [`inputsFrom`](https://nixos.org/manual/nixpkgs/stable/#sec-pkgs-mkShell-attributes)을 사용해 패키지의 의존성을 환경으로 가져옵니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dependencies": "의존성",
        "package": "패키지"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:20:02.575475Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "Finally, import the `shell` attribute in `shell.nix`:",
      "source_hash": 1662050016041825435,
      "context_hash": 18370064277514204180,
      "translation": "마지막으로 `shell.nix`에서 `shell` 속성을 가져오십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "attribute": "속성"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:20:02.575475Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "Check the development environment, it contains the build-time dependency `cowsay`:",
      "source_hash": 7862352424627360402,
      "context_hash": 12308549624573497516,
      "translation": "개발 환경을 확인해 보면, 빌드 타임 의존성인 `cowsay`가 포함되어 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dependency": "의존성",
        "development environment": "개발 환경"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T15:20:02.575475Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Next steps",
      "source_hash": 16066775224842874840,
      "context_hash": 2316803547527409324,
